<div class="min-h-screen bg-base-100">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-16 px-6">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-base-content/70 mb-8">Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <h2>The Short Version</h2>
      <p>
        We collect what we need to run the service and nothing more. We don't sell
        your data. Your audio files are yours, and we delete them after processing.
      </p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

      <h3>Account Information</h3>
      <p>
        When you create an account, we collect your email address and password
        (stored securely hashed, never in plain text).
      </p>

      <h3>Audio Files</h3>
      <p>
        You upload audio files for processing. We store these temporarily while
        processing and for a limited time afterward so you can download the results.
        Files are automatically deleted after 7 days.
      </p>

      <h3>Usage Data</h3>
      <p>
        We collect basic analytics about how you use the service: pages visited,
        features used, processing jobs created. This helps us improve the service.
      </p>

      <h3>Payment Information</h3>
      <p>
        If you subscribe to a paid plan, payment processing is handled by Stripe.
        We don't store your full credit card number - only a reference to your
        Stripe customer record.
      </p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide and improve the Service</li>
        <li>To communicate with you about your account</li>
        <li>To process payments</li>
        <li>To detect and prevent abuse</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We don't sell your personal information. We may share data with:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Service providers who help us operate (hosting, payment processing)</li>
        <li>Law enforcement if legally required</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We use industry-standard security measures to protect your data, including
        encryption in transit and at rest. Audio files are stored in encrypted
        cloud storage with access controls.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access your account data through the settings page</li>
        <li>Delete your account at any time</li>
        <li>Request a copy of your data by contacting us</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use essential cookies to keep you logged in and remember your preferences.
        We don't use tracking cookies for advertising.
      </p>

      <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is not intended for children under 13. We don't knowingly
        collect data from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy from time to time. We'll notify you of significant
        changes via email.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about privacy? Contact us at privacy@munchycow.com.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-base-300">
      <.link href={~p"/"} class="btn btn-ghost">
        &larr; Back to home
      </.link>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
